{
  "$comment": "Pre-send confirmation decision. Called once per user-initiated send after pre-send compaction, with the assembled plan estimate estimatedInput (P-hat, rho_hi included), the effective window result B / limitedBy (budget.v1.json windowCases), the price line T (null for managed / Free / Relay), the conversation local state, and the per-M base / long-context prices. Cost is input only, USD, rounded to 6 decimals; display rounding is the end's cost formatter.",
  "schema": "oriveo.context-cap-confirm",
  "version": 1,
  "rules": [
    "overCap = attempt in {send, edit} and limitedBy == custom and B != null and estimatedInput > B (strictly). Asked every time; confirming changes no state.",
    "priceLine = attempt in {send, edit} and T != null and estimatedInput >= T and reminderEnabled and not conversationState.suppressed and conversationState.acknowledged != {model, T} (both equal). regenerate / retry / continue / overflowRecovery / toolLoopLeg never ask (the content was already confirmed or is not a new user message).",
    "kind = overCapAndPriceLine when both, else overCap / priceLine / none. Both: one dialog with the over-cap title, the over-cap sentence and then the price-line sentence.",
    "showDontAsk = priceLine. Confirming with it checked sets conversationState.suppressed = true. Any confirm while priceLine sets conversationState.acknowledged = acknowledgeOnConfirm = {model, T}. Cancel changes nothing.",
    "cost (only when priceLine) = {long: estimatedInput * long.prompt / 1e6, base: estimatedInput * base.prompt / 1e6} rounded to 6 decimals, when base.prompt > 0 and long.prompt > 0; else null.",
    "multiplier (only when priceLine and cost is null and pricing present) = context-cap-presentation panel rule: per side tenths = round(long / base * 10), base <= 0 or missing = null, keep only > 10; both null = null.",
    "conversationState is local to the device (not synced), keyed by conversation id: {suppressed: bool, acknowledged: {model, T} | null}; missing = {false, null}."
  ],
